---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { IHF } from "../../config";
---
<Base
  title={IHF.name}
  description="CIF's research and advocacy arm. Scorecards, playbooks, and policy research built to be used by civil society. Home of AI Skepticism."
>
  <div class="wrap phead">
    <h1>{IHF.name}.</h1>
    <p class="sub">
      CIF's research and advocacy arm. Independent inquiry into the forces reshaping human
      life, published as instruments other people can pick up and use.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="shead"><h2>Research that ends in something usable.</h2></div>
      <div class="prin">
        <div class="pr">
          <h3>Scorecards.</h3>
          <p>Assessments that let someone outside an institution measure it against a standard it did not set.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pr">
          <h3>Playbooks.</h3>
          <p>Step-by-step material for people who have to act, not people who have to be persuaded.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pr">
          <h3>Policy research.</h3>
          <p>Work aimed at the specific person who can change a rule, written so they can act on it without a translator.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="credo" style="padding:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 style="color:#fff;font-size:clamp(27px,3.4vw,40px);max-width:20ch">AI Skepticism</h2>
      <p class="attr" style="margin-top:22px;max-width:58ch">
        The Institute's convening program. It brings together the people and institutions
        rethinking artificial intelligence and public life. Canada is Edition One.
      </p>
      <p class="attr" style="margin-top:16px;max-width:58ch">
        Skepticism here is not opposition. It is the ordinary practice of asking an
        institution to show its work before granting it trust, applied to a technology
        that has mostly been exempted from it. CIF holds itself to the same test.
      </p>
      <a class="pill" href="/contact">Host or partner on Edition One &rsaquo;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="shead"><h2>Where the Institute lives.</h2></div>
      <p class="dnote" style="margin-top:0">
        The Institute is building its own home at
        <a href={IHF.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">forhumanfutures.org</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
